NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Mr. Chair, yun naman po talagang ginagawa namin eh.

asr-002675
01:32:40.800 --> 01:32:51.080
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Nag-submit naman kami talaga po ng list, yung validated namin. May plano kami, may right of way. Yung basta yung shovel-ready projects namin, yun naman po talaga yung sinasubmit namin.

asr-002676
01:32:51.480 --> 01:33:01.200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yun na nga. So, you don't actually need the special provision? You don't actually need the change eh? Pwede nang ilabas yan basta may listahan ng project? Pwede nang ilabas ng DBM?

asr-002677
01:33:01.760 --> 01:33:06.940
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Pwede naman po. Kaya lang, the list of the projects is not an integral part of the SARO po.

asr-002678
01:33:07.420 --> 01:33:10.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, it should be. Kasi yun na nga yung Annex A.

asr-002679
01:33:10.800 --> 01:33:24.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: At yun yung pinagbabasehan nung pre-award process of bidding sort of award. Pag nagbago yun, bago lahat.

asr-002680
01:33:25.140 --> 01:33:40.540
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Kasi yun pong listing na sinasabi ko since before po 2026, pag nagre-release po kami ng SARO to MIA, kung ano po yung nakalagay lang sa GAA na programs and sub-programs, yun lang po ang makikita.

asr-002681
01:33:40.800 --> 01:33:42.900
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Wala po siyang attachment na list.

asr-002682
01:33:43.060 --> 01:33:48.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero sa general rule, yung sa approval, di ba nakakabit na yung listahan doon? Doon sa approval.

asr-002683
01:33:48.640 --> 01:33:52.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Only in 2026. Before that, walang listahan sabi niyo, doon sa Annex, di ba?

asr-002684
01:33:52.820 --> 01:33:57.860
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Before 2026, wala pong listahan na nakakasama sa GAA and even in the next.

asr-002685
01:33:58.140 --> 01:34:02.380
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Hindi, wala sa GAA. Pero doon sa approval ninyo.

asr-002686
01:34:03.080 --> 01:34:03.660
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Wala po.

asr-002687
01:34:04.220 --> 01:34:07.880
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Hindi, meron. Wala sa GAA. Pero sa approval, meron.

asr-002688
01:34:08.940 --> 01:34:10.780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nakatanggap na ako ng gano'n na nakakita.

asr-002689
01:34:10.800 --> 01:34:12.440
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nakatanggap na ako eh, nung governor ako.

asr-002690
01:34:13.780 --> 01:34:18.240
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Meron po siyang list, pero we use that only during our evaluation.

asr-002691
01:34:18.460 --> 01:34:27.240
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Ang sinasabi ko po, Madam, Madam, Mr. Chair, is pag nirelease po namin yung allotment, wala po siyang kasamang list.

asr-002692
01:34:28.100 --> 01:34:32.700
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Hindi po siya, wala po siyang attachment na list of the projects.

asr-002693
01:34:33.580 --> 01:34:35.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Tama po kayo, ma'am eh. May listahan po lang.

asr-002694
01:34:35.360 --> 01:34:38.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: May listahan doon sa approval eh. Nakakabit doon eh.

asr-002695
01:34:38.360 --> 01:34:38.740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Apo.

asr-002696
01:34:39.280 --> 01:34:40.780
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So kahit wala sana yun.

asr-002697
01:34:40.800 --> 01:34:42.980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kahit yung old, ano sana, okay yun.

asr-002698
01:34:44.760 --> 01:34:49.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Otherwise, ano yung basis ng COA na sitahin kayo kung wala yung listahan?

asr-002699
01:34:54.400 --> 01:35:00.020
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Before po kasi, meron po siyang listahan kasi hindi pa po siya naka-PREC-C.

asr-002700
01:35:00.560 --> 01:35:03.700
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Hindi pa po tayo naka-Program Expenditure Classification.

asr-002701
01:35:04.120 --> 01:35:10.780
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Naka-ano pa po siya, naka-by yung cost structure, meaning gas, STO.

asr-002702
01:35:10.800 --> 01:35:14.380
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Meron po talaga siyang list. Makapal po na list yun.

asr-002703
01:35:14.720 --> 01:35:16.900
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Pero that was before the PREC-C.

asr-002704
01:35:17.460 --> 01:35:22.980
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Yung sinasabi po ni Administrator ngayon na PREC-C, yan na po yung program, sub-program.

asr-002705
01:35:23.140 --> 01:35:28.440
DBM Director Elena Regina S. Brillantes: Hindi na po kami nag-a-attach ng list nung nag-PREC-C na po tayo.

asr-002706
01:35:30.680 --> 01:35:32.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay, so we'll figure it out.

asr-002707
01:35:32.980 --> 01:35:39.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: In fact, before we started this hearing, I requested the Administrator that we will sit down

asr-002708
01:35:39.020 --> 01:35:40.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: and test this out in a separate session.

asr-002709
01:35:40.800 --> 01:35:47.740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Before plenary. Para lang mahimay natin ng maayos.

asr-002710
01:35:48.740 --> 01:35:53.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay, there are a few more questions. Halimbawa itong...

asr-002711
01:35:56.400 --> 01:35:58.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Unless ma'am, you said...

asr-002712
01:35:58.060 --> 01:35:59.860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I'm happy to listen.

asr-002713
01:36:00.060 --> 01:36:00.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay, thank you.

asr-002714
01:36:04.780 --> 01:36:05.740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Dito sa...

asr-002715
01:36:05.740 --> 01:36:10.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, balikan ko lang yung binanggit kanina na sasagutin.

asr-002716
01:36:10.800 --> 01:36:12.720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Solar pump, sir.

asr-002717
01:36:13.100 --> 01:36:14.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, yes. Before that.

asr-002718
01:36:14.380 --> 01:36:17.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yung scale of non-operational service area, di ba?

asr-002719
01:36:18.860 --> 01:36:25.520
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kasi, humihingi kayo ng additional funding for new air, di ba?

asr-002720
01:36:27.020 --> 01:36:28.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: New service areas.

asr-002721
01:36:29.280 --> 01:36:32.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, ang tanong dun eh, ano ba, saan nyo ba kailangan yung funding?

asr-002722
01:36:32.580 --> 01:36:35.440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Dun sa new service areas? Saan nyo talagang kailangan?

asr-002723
01:36:35.900 --> 01:36:39.740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: O dun sa non-operational service areas?

asr-002724
01:36:39.740 --> 01:36:40.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Di ba? Parang ano yan?

asr-002725
01:36:40.800 --> 01:36:45.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But anyway, we requested you to make submissions of your latest.

asr-002726
01:36:46.180 --> 01:36:49.160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kasi lumalabas dito, times four yung...

asr-002727
01:36:49.160 --> 01:36:54.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: It's more than times four, yung scale of non-operational services

asr-002728
01:36:54.540 --> 01:36:56.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: based on the new service area.

asr-002729
01:36:57.380 --> 01:37:01.100
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ibig sabihin, dapat ba dun natin sa new service area

asr-002730
01:37:01.100 --> 01:37:02.520
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: i-budget yung amounts?

asr-002731
01:37:02.660 --> 01:37:07.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: O dun sa hindi pa naaayos na times four?

asr-002732
01:37:07.320 --> 01:37:09.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: I don't know. I don't know the answer to that question.

asr-002733
01:37:09.540 --> 01:37:10.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But that can be raised.

asr-002734
01:37:10.800 --> 01:37:20.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, why put it in new areas when you already have 45,000 hectares of unserviceable areas?

asr-002735
01:37:20.980 --> 01:37:22.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Can you explain that, sir?

asr-002736
01:37:23.860 --> 01:37:27.680
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair. Actually po kasi ang approach ng IAGENCY eh,

asr-002737
01:37:27.700 --> 01:37:33.200
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: meron po tayong, of course, short-term, medium-term, and long-term plans po.

asr-002738
01:37:34.080 --> 01:37:37.180
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Nakikita nyo po yung sa mga new areas na target natin are,

asr-002739
01:37:37.180 --> 01:37:40.580
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: ito po yung mga legacy projects, yung malalaki pong projects.

asr-002740
01:37:40.800 --> 01:37:44.760
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Like the Inisaip, yung Tumawini, Balog-Balog.

asr-002741
01:37:45.000 --> 01:37:46.520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, kailangan pa rin po natin punduhan yan.

asr-002742
01:37:46.640 --> 01:37:49.940
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Lalo na po yung Balog-Balog kasi nasimulan po yun, Mr. Chair.

asr-002743
01:37:50.280 --> 01:37:51.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, kailangan natin punduhan yan.

asr-002744
01:37:51.900 --> 01:37:56.640
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And of course, for the short-term, nandoon po talaga yung ating repair and restoration.

asr-002745
01:37:57.100 --> 01:38:01.060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pero kung napansin po ninyo, lumiit talaga yung repair and restore budget namin ngayon.

asr-002746
01:38:01.480 --> 01:38:08.320
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Dahil po, marami kaming ongoing projects, especially the big projects for big ticket projects.

asr-002747
01:38:08.320 --> 01:38:09.320
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Eh, ang...

asr-002748
01:38:10.800 --> 01:38:13.520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: May contractual obligations po tayo dito, Mr. Chair.

asr-002749
01:38:13.600 --> 01:38:15.540
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Like the Balog-Balog, naipabid na po natin yan.

asr-002750
01:38:15.700 --> 01:38:17.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, kailangan namin punduhan yan.

asr-002751
01:38:17.820 --> 01:38:20.960
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So, nung nilabas yung budget namin, siyempre prioritization tayo.

asr-002752
01:38:21.320 --> 01:38:23.860
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Unahin natin yung ongoing kasi nga may contractual obligation.

asr-002753
01:38:25.560 --> 01:38:27.820
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But kung, you know, tama rin po kayo.

asr-002754
01:38:28.020 --> 01:38:31.420
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Dapat talaga mabigyan ng prioridad yung repair and restore.

asr-002755
01:38:31.600 --> 01:38:33.120
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kasi nandyan na po yung system.

asr-002756
01:38:33.520 --> 01:38:34.760
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Nandyan na yung IAs natin.

asr-002757
01:38:34.840 --> 01:38:35.740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Na-train na natin.

asr-002758
01:38:35.740 --> 01:38:40.740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And mas mababa po talaga ang cost natin for the rehab ng ating...

asr-002759
01:38:40.800 --> 01:38:42.280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: ating mga repairs.

asr-002760
01:38:42.440 --> 01:38:44.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pero ito, mga ito po, kasi Mr. Chair,

asr-002761
01:38:44.660 --> 01:38:49.680
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: dahil nga nakasanayan natin na yung pundo ng mga ito ay nire-request namin sa OCD.

asr-002762
01:38:50.140 --> 01:38:50.740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kaya hindi ho...

asr-002763
01:38:50.740 --> 01:38:51.840
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Malaki po yung request namin.

asr-002764
01:38:52.040 --> 01:38:54.040
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Actually, nasa 13 billion, ano,

asr-002765
01:38:54.520 --> 01:38:56.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: ang request namin sa OCD.

asr-002766
01:38:56.840 --> 01:38:58.040
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Dahil OCD.

asr-002767
01:38:58.900 --> 01:39:01.960
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kasi typhoon damage po ang karamihan ng mga ito.

asr-002768
01:39:02.240 --> 01:39:03.680
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pero may QRF po kayo.

asr-002769
01:39:05.060 --> 01:39:05.920
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, ma'am.

asr-002770
01:39:05.920 --> 01:39:09.180
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But yung QRF po kasi ang pwede lang namin i-repair.

asr-002771
01:39:09.200 --> 01:39:10.780
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yung mga recent damages lamang po.

asr-002772
01:39:10.800 --> 01:39:12.800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ito namang mga previously...

asr-002773
01:39:14.240 --> 01:39:16.160
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Because is yung dati ng...

asr-002774
01:39:16.160 --> 01:39:17.820
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yun po yung setup natin, Mr. Chair.

asr-002775
01:39:17.880 --> 01:39:19.160
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Wala po kaming QRF.

asr-002776
01:39:19.460 --> 01:39:23.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Simply, Calamity Fund, dapat humingi po kami sa OCD.

asr-002777
01:39:24.000 --> 01:39:26.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: That's why I was, you know, sinasabi ko nga po sa inyo,

asr-002778
01:39:26.580 --> 01:39:29.400
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: nagtataka nga po ako dahil itong ahensya na ito,

asr-002779
01:39:29.860 --> 01:39:33.240
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: yung sa LGUs nga, 5% ang automatic na Calamity Fund eh.

asr-002780
01:39:33.560 --> 01:39:37.880
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kung ganun lang sana ang initial po na setup ng agency na ito,

asr-002781
01:39:37.880 --> 01:39:39.880
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: hindi ho sana dumami yung...

asr-002782
01:39:40.800 --> 01:39:43.300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: ating mga repair and restoration.

asr-002783
01:39:43.700 --> 01:39:50.120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Can you submit to this committee yung listahan ng mga OCD pending request ninyo?

asr-002784
01:39:50.320 --> 01:39:51.140
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, sir.

asr-002785
01:39:51.820 --> 01:39:52.600
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Sa 30 billion.

asr-002786
01:39:53.180 --> 01:39:56.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Mr. Chair, ang isa pa po, kaya importante,

asr-002787
01:39:56.680 --> 01:39:58.800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: importante po na...

asr-002788
01:40:00.120 --> 01:40:02.800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ito rin po ang isang importansya ng by-prexy na...

asr-002789
01:40:03.320 --> 01:40:06.160
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: by-prexy po na program na hinihingi namin.

asr-002790
01:40:06.640 --> 01:40:09.180
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: For example, nakalign item yung budget po namin.

asr-002791
01:40:09.180 --> 01:40:10.300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Nakalign item siya talaga.

asr-002792
01:40:10.800 --> 01:40:12.780
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kung may bagyo na dumating.

asr-002793
01:40:13.180 --> 01:40:16.120
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Since kailangan namin,

asr-002794
01:40:16.780 --> 01:40:20.300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: pwede namin i-program kasi yung repair and restoration namin

asr-002795
01:40:20.300 --> 01:40:24.280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: doon sa may standing crop na needing repair po kaagad.

asr-002796
01:40:24.520 --> 01:40:27.160
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So yung flexibility po, nandun talaga.

asr-002797
01:40:27.320 --> 01:40:30.620
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Naramdaman namin po itong mahirap na sitwasyon na ito

asr-002798
01:40:30.620 --> 01:40:34.540
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: pag may mga dumarating po tayo, mga calamities ngayon.

asr-002799
01:40:34.640 --> 01:40:37.500
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Talagang nakatali po ang kamay ng niya dito.

asr-002800
01:40:37.500 --> 01:40:40.680
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So I hope matulungan nyo po.

asr-002801
01:40:40.800 --> 01:40:43.360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Matulungan kami, matulungan kami ng DBM para lang...

asr-002802
01:40:43.360 --> 01:40:45.040
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Hindi ho namin uliting ko po, Mr. Chair.

asr-002803
01:40:45.140 --> 01:40:48.720
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Hindi namin hinihingi po na lamsam yung budget ng niya.

asr-002804
01:40:49.140 --> 01:40:51.940
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Bigyan lamang po kami ng flexibility para...

asr-002805
01:40:51.940 --> 01:40:55.800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Nakalista pa rin po yung sistema nila sa budget.

asr-002806
01:40:55.920 --> 01:40:57.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Well, nabanggit nyo yung balog-balog.

asr-002807
01:40:58.040 --> 01:41:02.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kausap ko lang si Governor Nanay Pineda ng Pampanga.

asr-002808
01:41:03.200 --> 01:41:08.580
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Well, ang lumalabas kasi pinakamatinding baha since 1972

asr-002809
01:41:08.580 --> 01:41:10.580
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ang dinanas ng Pampanga.

asr-002810
01:41:10.800 --> 01:41:17.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: At hanggang ngayon, 36 or 40 days na ba pa rin.

asr-002811
01:41:17.880 --> 01:41:21.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ngayon, may nababanggit silang, yun na nga,

asr-002812
01:41:21.400 --> 01:41:26.740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: yung in-announce ni Presidente na Sabo Dams,

asr-002813
01:41:27.160 --> 01:41:35.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: upstream, pababa, as part of the whole strategic master plan.

asr-002814
01:41:35.980 --> 01:41:39.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So ang tanong ko is, ano ang gagawin ng niya dito sa...

asr-002815
01:41:40.800 --> 01:41:45.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: problema na ito at yung pinoproposed na solusyon ni Governor Pineda?

asr-002816
01:41:46.580 --> 01:41:47.800
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair. Buti natin.

asr-002817
01:41:48.220 --> 01:41:52.860
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Actually po, 2023 pa lang na utusan na tayo ni Presidente BBM na

asr-002818
01:41:52.860 --> 01:41:57.480
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: pag-aralan po kung paano makapaglagay ng pang-irrigation dyan

asr-002819
01:41:57.480 --> 01:41:59.300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: at the same time makakatulong po sa pagbaha.

asr-002820
01:41:59.380 --> 01:42:05.460
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So inaaral po namin yung river basins po ng Pampanga at Bulacan.

asr-002821
01:42:05.540 --> 01:42:09.260
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: And you will be surprised. Medyo madali lang sana ang solusyon po na ito.

asr-002822
01:42:09.260 --> 01:42:10.160
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002823
01:42:10.800 --> 01:42:13.420
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Sir Ma, pwede ba natin ipakita sa...

asr-002824
01:42:13.420 --> 01:42:18.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay, okay, go ahead. Sige.

asr-002825
01:42:19.720 --> 01:42:23.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pinangako ko kay Governor kasi na tututukan ko ito eh.

asr-002826
01:42:23.860 --> 01:42:25.440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kaya, sige, go ahead.

asr-002845
