asr-005761
04:05:50.060 --> 04:05:52.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Eh 42 pesos

asr-005762
04:05:52.060 --> 04:05:54.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: lang to a dollar nun.

asr-005763
