asr-005767
04:06:04.060 --> 04:06:05.060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Bulk water.

asr-005768
04:06:05.060 --> 04:06:09.060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Nagtatayo pa ng airport.

asr-005769
04:06:09.060 --> 04:06:12.060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Saan mo kukunin po ang tubig nun?

asr-005770
04:06:12.060 --> 04:06:15.060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kung hindi ka mag-impound sa taas.

asr-005771
04:06:15.060 --> 04:06:20.060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: So heating multiple birds with one stone po ito eh.

asr-005772
04:06:20.060 --> 04:06:22.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Bulk water.

asr-005773
04:06:22.060 --> 04:06:23.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Potable water.

asr-005774
04:06:23.060 --> 04:06:24.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Irrigation.

asr-005775
04:06:24.060 --> 04:06:26.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Flood control.

asr-005776
04:06:26.060 --> 04:06:27.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Power.

asr-005777
04:06:27.060 --> 04:06:28.060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Aquaculture.

asr-005778
04:06:28.060 --> 04:06:29.060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Aquaculture.

asr-005779
04:06:29.060 --> 04:06:34.060
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Tapos may tourism ano pa po ito dahil may nalungkaw po ito eh.

asr-005780
04:06:34.060 --> 04:06:37.060
